    5. Compose each group vertically — marker on top, object directly below (0-row gap),
       marker starting at object col + 1
    6. Place all groups on the grid with Chebyshev spacing >= 2 between any two groups
    7. Validate: exactly 2 non-bg colors, each object has exactly one unambiguous marker above it
